WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 004. A PILE OF SOURCES IS NOT INTELLIGENCE.. The transformation happens through explicit gates.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
01 · COLLECT. REGISTER THE SOURCE.. Issuer · version · source date · checked date · exact locator.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
02 · SEPARATE. SOURCE ≠ ANALYST CLAIM.. Interpretation gets its own object instead of silently inheriting provenance.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
03 · VERIFY. UNVERIFIED STAYS OUT.. Verified requires a note; contradiction and uncertainty remain visible.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
04 · BRIEF. SYNTHESIS FOLLOWS STATUS.. The brief cannot quietly promote unchecked assertions into findings.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. COLLECT → SEPARATE → VERIFY → BRIEF. Make the research method inspectable before automating any part of it.

